# Looking back from the corridor (level.c's broken glass over the hole): up, a few steps on,
# turned right round, and walking back up to the glass.
# Film it with tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps look_back.steps (built with BOOT_ON_FOOT 1)
wait_up # booted on foot in the corridor (BOOT_ON_FOOT): no ride there
hold up 1
# Right round: about 1.4 s at 90 degrees in ~0.7 s
hold left 1.4
wait 0.3
shot lb_00_looking_back
hold up 3
wait 0.3
shot lb_01_nearer
hold up 4
wait 0.3
shot lb_02_at_the_glass
keydown y
wait 0.6
shot lb_03_look_up
keyup y
keydown b
wait 0.6
shot lb_04_look_down
keyup b
keydown c
keydown z
wait 0.6
shot lb_05_look_right
keyup c
keyup z
